    "q-140439": {
      "dom_id": "step-q140439",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Given that $f(x)=4\\cdot {2}^{x}+{x}^{3}-{e}^{2}$,  find the slope of the tangent at $x=0.$",
      "worked_solution": "Applying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4\\cdot {2}^{x}+{x}^{3}-{e}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4\\cdot {2}^{x})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-{e}^{2}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot {2}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})+0 \\\\  & =4\\cdot {2}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+3{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=0$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & =(4\\cdot {2}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+3{x}^{2}){|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =4\\cdot {2}^{0}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+3\\cdot {0}^{2} \\\\  & =4\\cdot 1\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡2+3\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-140439-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"41\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-140439-b",
